<title>UK: SOCCER-BLACKBURN WAIT ON PETERSEN.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BLACKBURN WAIT ON PETERSEN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>English premier league Blackburn Rovers are still pursuing Monaco's Danish striker Dan Petersen despite the resignation of manager Ray Harford, the club said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Blackburn's caretaker manager Tony Parkes said: &quot;We are waiting to hear whether the player will join us for a week's trial.&quot;</p>
